==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₂er-}}
From {{af|ru|inert|lang1=en|-ный}} or from {{af|ru|inerte|lang1=fr|-ный}}. Ultimately from {{der|ru|la|iners}}.

